            Tons of tools. Zero spreadsheets.
          </h2>
          <p
            class="mt-4 text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-pretty text-stone-600"
          >
            Everything your club actually needs to run — together in one place,
            so your board, your staff, and your members all see the same truth.
          </p>
        </div>

        <dl
          class="grid grid-cols-1 divide-y divide-stone-300 border-y border-stone-300 md:grid-cols-2 md:divide-x md:divide-y-0"
        >
