                    Flows fit together intentionally — no fragile glue between
                    unrelated extensions.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4 p-6 md:p-8">
                <span
                  class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-medium tracking-wide text-amber-700"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  →
                </span>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-stone-900">
                    Fits today, grows tomorrow
                  </div>
                  <p
                    class="mt-2 max-w-[48ch] text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-stone-600"
                  >
                    Ready for modest communities now, with room to expand
                    billing, facilities, and staff workflows as you approach HOA
                    or country-club scale.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4 p-6 md:p-8">
                <span
                  class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-medium tracking-wide text-amber-700"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  →
                </span>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-stone-900">
                    Ownership of your stack
